Package: NormGen
Title: An Efficient and Precise Quantile Mapping for Normal Pseudo-Random Number Generation
Version: 0.0.5
Authors@R: person("Piotr", "Sulewski", , "piotr.sulewski@upsl.edu.pl", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Description: High-performance pseudo-normal random generator using an optimized 'quantile mapping' algorithm. It provides fast generation of normal pseudo-random numbers based on precise mathematical approximations. Version 0.0.5 updates the package and publication title to be more concise, precise, and readable for the community.
